WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:15.290
The chart shows that the gross enrollment ratio in higher education in China rose dramatically from 3.4% in 1990 to 51.6% in 2019.
图表显示，中国高等教育毛入学率从1990年的3.4%大幅上升到2019年的51.6%。

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:25.560
After modest growth in the 1990s, the ratio climbed rapidly, reaching 21% in 2005 and 30% in 2012.
在20世纪90年代增长平缓之后，这一比率迅速攀升，2005年达到21%，2012年达到30%。

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:33.740
In 2019, it exceeded 50% for the first time, a historic milestone for Chinese higher education.
2019年，这一比率首次超过50%，成为中国高等教育的一个历史性里程碑。

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:38.960
These figures reflect China’s remarkable achievements in higher education.
这些数据体现了中国在高等教育方面取得的非凡成就。

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:49.740
In just three decades, a college education has gone from a privilege enjoyed by a small minority to an opportunity available to a large share of young people.
短短三十年间，大学教育已经从少数人享有的特权，变成了很大一部分年轻人都能获得的机会。

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:58.170
Millions of students, including many from rural and low-income families, now have the chance to change their lives through knowledge.
数以百万计的学生，其中包括许多来自农村和低收入家庭的学生，如今有机会通过知识改变自己的命运。

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:10.829
At the same time, the expansion of higher education has provided the country with a large pool of skilled professionals, supporting its rapid economic development and technological progress.
与此同时，高等教育的扩大为国家提供了大批技术人才，支撑了国家经济的快速发展和科技进步。

00:01:11.629 --> 00:01:14.999
Nevertheless, expanding enrollment is only the first step.
然而，扩大招生只是第一步。

00:01:15.799 --> 00:01:24.589
In the future, more attention should be paid to improving the quality of education and making sure that graduates have the skills society needs.
今后，应当更加重视提高教育质量，确保毕业生具备社会所需的技能。

00:01:25.389 --> 00:01:32.319
When quantity and quality go hand in hand, higher education will contribute even more to the nation’s development.
当数量与质量齐头并进时，高等教育将为国家的发展作出更大的贡献。
